#
# NOTE ON THE [D-default] BLOCK
# Enabling ARCH_HISI makes 6.18 default-enable every other Hisilicon SoC's
# clock/reset/thermal driver (their Kconfig has "default ARCH_HISI"). That is
# how upstream namespaces the symbol today; it is not a luofu design choice.
# Two clean options exist for the submission (decide with review):
#   1. add explicit "# CONFIG_COMMON_CLK_HI... is not set" lines here, or
#   2. tighten those Kconfig defaults upstream when luofu is added.
# Neither is done in this derivation: the file records what oldconfig did.
